'''Jake's House''' is an area in the {{Zone|Mushroom Desert}}. It is located on the highest mountain on the island at {{Coordinates|255|183|-565}} and it is the place where players can find {{NPCSprite|Jake}}.

{{ZoneText|Talk to Jake.}}

== Location ==
'''Jake's House''' is a small wooden house located on the highest mountain. Inside, there's a small cyan bed as well as a small table with a Cauldron. In the middle of the house there's {{NPCSprite|Jake}}.

